@title Hostile: resize to tiny and huge windows with dialogs and menus open
@area Hostile
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text standards check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 15
resize 800 500
wait 10
shot standards-800
resize 480 320
wait 10
shot standards-480
resize 300 200
wait 10
shot standards-300
resize 1000 700
wait 10
key Escape
try click_text Cabinet #1
try click_text Cab #1
wait 20
resize 400 300
wait 10
shot cabinet-400
try click_text "3D" #1
wait 20
resize 3000 1800
wait 20
shot 3d-3000
resize 640 360
wait 10
shot 3d-640
try click_text Reports #1
try click_text Rpt #1
wait 10
resize 1366 768
wait 20
shot back
check_blank back
